frastructure, industrial infrastructure, water & environment and transportation and is now set to enter progressive sectors like tourism. While we've carried out challenging projects in the last 30 years, we've also been reputed with doing the same in the shortest span of time.    To carry out our unique quest of making a difference to countless lives, we have a skilled team of difference-makers as well. Each of our employees is skilled in his/her discipline, with a willingness to transform the world into a better place.    The trust, togetherness and loyalty which Neev inspires are deeply ingrained","score":0.6506676,"raw_content":null,"id":"9e3892-05"},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_neev-horizon-borivali-west_3103.html","title":"Neev Horizon Borivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | Property Crow","content":"Note: Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. \\Rates are indicative.\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK Floor Plan\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nAddress: Ashok Nagar, Mumbai\n\nClose To: Ashok Nagar, Eksar Road & Bapu Nagar\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about NEEV HORIZON\n\n## Share This Project\n\n## Similar Properties in Borivali West\n\nShree Madhuvan Dham\n\nby Sunder Corporation\n\n### Shree Madhuvan Dham\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSumit Garden Grove\n\nby Sumit Woods Pvt. Ltd\n\n### Sumit Garden Grove\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nHiranandani Aven\n\nby House of Hiranandani\n\n### Hiranandani Aven\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nHiranandani Bayview\n\nby House of Hiranandani [...] PropertyCrow.com\nPropertyCrow.com\nNeev Horizon\nNeev Horizon\n\nby Neev Group\n\n# Neev Horizon\n\nAshok Nagar, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK & 3 BHK\n\nCode: PropertyCrow3103\n\n## NEEV HORIZON\n\nNeev Horizon is one of the well-known housing improvements in Borivali West, area of Mumbai. It is between the under structure projects of Neev Horizon. It has high quality yet properly developed homes. Developed by Neev Group, this project provides considerately built 2 BHK & 3 BHK flats with st\n\narting area from 1275 Sq.ft To 1475 Sq.ft modern features for the comfort and ease of residents. Adding to this, it is near to the market, medical center and many educational institutions.\n\nAdvantage of Location: [...] Developers:\n\nNeev Group is a private limited organization established in the year 1980. With a team that is rock strong; the company has had a top role in improvement of the varied infrastructures and has lead in this group being on top in the real estate industry. This group generates housing as well as the commercial homes in the real estate market place. The group is also quite popular for the high quality of their work in their past projects and many more in the direction.\n\nFor more information you may please contact us.\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n --- \n| 2 BHK | 1275 | On Request |\n| 3 BHK | 1475 | On Request |","score":0.62687886,"raw_content":null,"id":"9e9740-06"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/neev-horizon-borivali-west-mumbai-p40058","title":"Neev Horizon Borivali West Mumbai - AddressofChoice.com","content":"Neev Horizon in Borivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location. Master Plan Masterplan.","score":0.5746579,"raw_content":null,"id":"1bf410-07"}],"response_time":4.67,"request_id":"8165d763-df0b-4c32-aebd-cab7fb88b004"}